WEBVTT

00:07:29.796 --> 00:07:33.396
(Laughter)

00:07:33.436 --> 00:07:34.676
It's an algorithm.

00:07:35.516 --> 00:07:36.636
(Laughter)

00:07:36.676 --> 00:07:42.996
We also matched a father-in-law
and his very own daughter-in-law,

00:07:43.036 --> 00:07:47.796
because, obviously, they live close by
but have really different opinions.

00:07:47.796 --> 00:07:49.396
So as a general rule,

00:07:49.396 --> 00:07:53.796
we did not observe, record,
document the discussions,

00:07:53.836 --> 00:07:57.156
because we didn't want
people to perform in any way.

00:07:57.156 --> 00:07:59.276
But I made an exception.

00:07:59.316 --> 00:08:00.956
I took part myself.